# Architecture Checklist

- Keep domain logic free of framework and adapter imports.
- Define typed ports for external communication.
- Implement adapters in infrastructure modules and wire them through ports.
- Enforce dependency direction: outer layers depend on inner layers.

## Before Finishing

- New interfaces are placed in domain or application ports.
- Adapter-specific DTOs stay outside domain.
- Boundaries are explicit in package names and constructors.

## Example

Use `.agent/examples/architecture/hexagonal-kotlin.kt` as the reference shape.
